      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const d = $input.first().json;\n// Escape only the dynamic name used in the HTML greeting.\nfunction escapePatientName(value) {\n  return String(value)\n    .replace(/&/g, '&amp;')\n    .replace(/</g, '&lt;')\n    .replace(/>/g, '&gt;')\n    .replace(/\"/g, '&quot;')\n    .replace(/'/g, '&#39;');\n}\nconst greeting = d.patientName ? ('Dear ' + escapePatientName(d.patientName)) : 'Hi there';\nconst year = new Date().getFullYear();\n\nconst introText = `Andropause — sometimes called male menopause — affects millions of men as testosterone levels naturally decline with age. Symptoms such as fatigue, reduced libido, mood changes, decreased muscle mass, and difficulty maintaining erections can significantly impact your quality of life. Yet the majority of men who experience these changes never receive a diagnosis or treatment.<br/><br/>The good news is that low testosterone is measurable and treatable. A simple hormone panel can give you a clear picture of where your levels stand, and personalised hormone replacement therapy may help restore vitality, mental clarity, physical strength, and sexual function.<br/><br/>Diet and lifestyle also play an important role: regular resistance training, adequate sleep, reduced alcohol intake, and foods rich in zinc (oysters, pumpkin seeds, beef) and vitamin D may help support healthy testosterone production.<br/><br/>Please take a moment to consider testosterone testing through our home-based, private, secure testing programme, or from one of our participating partner labs.`;\n\nconst html = `<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head>\n<meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"/>\n<meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no\"/>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width; initial-scale=1.0; maximum-scale=1.0; user-scalable=no;\"/>\n<